Package: rummage
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, shared-mime-info, hicolor-icon-theme
Suggests: rummage-media
Description: Native Wayland file manager
 A file manager with column and grid views, isolated previews, configurable
 custom actions and an optional desktop file chooser portal.

Package: rummage-media
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, rummage (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Optional video thumbnails and still previews for rummage
 Isolated video decoding using system FFmpeg shared libraries. No FFmpeg
 command-line tools are required. This package does not provide playback.
